# CI dependency pins — the single source of truth for Build Check (makefile.yml)
# and Coverity (native-build.yml). Both load it with one early step:
#   grep -E '^PIN_[A-Z0-9_]+=[0-9a-f]{40}$' <path>/.github/ci-pins.env >> "$GITHUB_ENV"
# The format is strict on purpose: PIN_NAME=<40-hex>, one per line, no quotes and
# no inline comment after the hash — a typo'd pin must fail that grep, never load
# silently as a partial value. Put every note on its own comment line.
#
# ── Pinned (SHA-locked) ──
# ucode: 655ca6d = a0ca7b1^1 = last master BEFORE the FFI merge (PR#398).
# TRAP: any commit ON the PR#398 branch (incl. 19ffa8a) still ships the poisoned
# `unused` macro (collides with OpenSSL). Use first-parent (a0ca7b1^1) when moving
# this pin, NOT plain `git log`.
PIN_UCODE=655ca6d55f58135b8b35bfaec77404dc551632e3
# git.w1.fi/hostap — bpi leg
PIN_HOSTAP_2_11=4b8ac10cb77c3d4dbf7ccefbe697dc0578da374c
# git.w1.fi/hostap — rpi leg
PIN_HOSTAP_2_10=9d07b9447e76059a2ddef2a879c57d0934634188
# mediatek/meta-filogic
PIN_META_FILOGIC=c67a32a7c8876b328a8d1eeaca213e860d85b3ce
#
# ── Unpinned (clone default-branch tip — pin when ready; kept as documentation) ──
# PIN_UNIFIED_MESH=    # rdkcentral/unified-wifi-mesh (develop)
# PIN_RDK_WIFI_HAL=    # rdkcentral/rdk-wifi-hal      (develop)
# PIN_HALINTERFACE=    # rdkcentral/rdkb-halif-wifi   (develop)
# PIN_TROWER_BASE64=   # xmidt-org/trower-base64      (main)
# PIN_META_CMF_BPI=    # rdkcentral/meta-cmf-bananapi (default)
# PIN_HOSTAP_PATCHES=  # rdkcentral/hostap-patches    (rpi, default)
